%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ee703a3033055140a9e692c6dd5ea80, type: 3}
  m_Name: First
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  talkDatas:
  - cn: "\u554A\u2026\u961F\u957F\u4F60\u771F\u7684\u613F\u610F\u5E2E\u6211\u5417\uFF0C\u8FD9\u6BD5\u7ADF\u662F\u6211\u7684\u5DE5\u4F5C\u2026\u2026"
    en: Ah... Captain, are you really willing to help me? This is my job, after all...
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u6CA1\u6709\u6CA1\u6709\uFF0C\u6211\u6CA1\u6709\u4E3A\u96BE\u7684\u610F\u601D\uFF01"
    en: No, no, I didn't mean to make things difficult!
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u63A5\u4E0B\u6765\u5148\u7531\u6211\u6765\u8BB2\u89E3\u4E00\u4E0B\u64CD\u4F5C\u6D41\u7A0B\u3002"
    en: I will explain the operation process first.
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u5728\u7535\u8DEF\u677F\u7684\u4E24\u4FA7\u5206\u522B\u6709\u4EE3\u8868\u8FDB\u53E3\u548C\u51FA\u53E3\u7684\u7535\u7EBF\u3002"
    en: On both sides of the circuit board, there are wires representing the input
      and the output.
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u6211\u4EEC\u8981\u505A\u7684\u5C31\u662F\u4FDD\u8BC1\u5B83\u4EEC\u4E4B\u95F4\u7684\u7535\u8DEF\u8054\u901A\u3002"
    en: What we need to do is make sure the circuit between them is connected.
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u7535\u8DEF\u677F\u4E2D\u5B58\u5728\u4E00\u4E9B\u8FD9\u6837\u7684\u7F3A\u53E3\u3002"
    en: There are some gaps like this on the circuit board.
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u5982\u679C\u9700\u8981\u7684\u8BDD\u53EF\u4EE5\u5C06\u96F6\u4EF6\u76D2\u4E2D\u7684\u90E8\u4EF6\u7F6E\u5165\u7F3A\u53E3\u5904\u3002"
    en: If needed, you can place components from the parts box into the gaps.
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u6700\u540E\u4E5F\u662F\u6700\u91CD\u8981\u7684\u5C31\u662F\u8981\u6CE8\u610F\u201C\u65AD\u8DEF\u201D\u95EE\u9898\u3002"
    en: The last and most important thing is to pay attention to "open circuits."
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u5728\u7535\u8DEF\u677F\u5185\u63A5\u901A\u7684\u7535\u8DEF\u4E0D\u80FD\u65AD\u8054\uFF0C\u9700\u8981\u4FDD\u6301\u8054\u901A\u3002"
    en: The connected circuit inside the board cannot be interrupted. It must stay
      continuous.
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u4E5F\u5C31\u662F\u8BF4\u6BCF\u4E00\u4E2A\u90E8\u4EF6\u7684\u7AEF\u53E3\u8981\u4E48\u94FE\u63A5\u5176\u4ED6\u7AEF\u53E3\uFF0C\u8981\u4E48\u94FE\u63A5\u5230\u7535\u8DEF\u677F\u5916\u3002"
    en: In other words, every port on every component must either connect to another
      port or connect outside the circuit board.
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u5982\u679C\u4EA7\u751F\u4E86\u201C\u65AD\u8DEF\u201D\uFF0C\u5373\u4F7F\u7535\u8DEF\u8054\u901A\u4E5F\u65E0\u6CD5\u987A\u5229\u8FD0\u4F5C\uFF01"
    en: If an "open circuit" appears, even if the circuit is connected, it will not
      operate properly!
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u6240\u4EE5\u5982\u679C\u53D1\u73B0\u6CA1\u80FD\u987A\u5229\u63A5\u901A\uFF0C\u4E0D\u59A8\u8BA4\u771F\u6392\u67E5\u4E00\u4E0B\u201C\u65AD\u8DEF\u201D\u95EE\u9898\u5427\u3002"
    en: So if the connection does not work smoothly, it may be worth carefully checking
      for open circuits.
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  - cn: "\u603B\u2026\u603B\u4E4B\u5148\u8BD5\u8BD5\u5427\u961F\u957F\uFF0C\u5F88\u591A\u4E1C\u897F\u662F\u6CA1\u529E\u6CD5\u5149\u542C\u8BB2\u89E3\u5C31\u5B66\u4F1A\u7684\u3002"
    en: A-anyway, let us try it first, Captain. There are many things you cannot
      learn just by listening to an explanation.
    express: 0
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
  showed: 0
